      "uid": "zhcn:db811877220a733cec7a390a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好，来吧！我也会用自己的表现，\n让你明白我珍惜故乡的心意有多强烈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48244e78fb157723c00a854f7748992a9af59bd6816b9fec415882630965a1fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
