    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d006ebb6b5c130cef8db700",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对手是处于巅峰时期的北港火山，\n以及经验丰富的强敌奇锐骏，\n俨然是至今为止最强的阵容。即便如此──",
      "source_fingerprint": "8edd7b0d0ed2902a4c5a994e031a67ca4a2094271059adcbcd7c574429fd2d3d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
